  "id": "shiny-rayquaza-ex-box",
  "name": "Shiny Rayquaza-EX Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "A box sold from 19 August 2015 with the Shiny Rayquaza-EX promo XY69 at regular size and as a jumbo, four booster packs, a code card for the online game and one of three Shiny jumbos from Ancient Origins: Primal Kyogre-EX, Primal Groudon-EX or M Rayquaza-EX. The Rayquaza-EX promo first came in Japan in a mail-in campaign held around the release of Emerald Break. Each Ancient Origins jumbo went to its own stores: in the United States the Primal Kyogre-EX box was a Toys \"R\" Us exclusive and the Primal Groudon-EX box a GameStop exclusive, and Australia had only those two, at EB Games.",
